  "description": "\nSherry FitzGerald Lettings Cork brings this handsome three bedroom semi-detached home to the rental market. \nIt is located within the small development of Fort Hill, overlooking Douglas and offering excellent access to all local amenities, including the ABC Childcare creche around the corner.\n\nAccommodation is bright and spacious throughout and the property has been decorated to a high standard.\nIt includes a front reception room with open fireplace, a large kitchen / dining room, utility room, guest w.c., two double bedrooms (master en-suite), a single bedroom and a main family bathroom. \nExternally, there is a two car cobble-locked drive way. The back garden is enclosed and gated and provides a handy wooden shed for extra storage of bikes and balls.\n\nThis property will make a comfortable  home and viewing will certainly reward. \n\nB.E.R. C1\n\nDirections:\nFrom the Finger Post Roundabout, take the Maryborough Hill exit. \nTravel up the hill for 2 miles, passing Douglas Golf Club in the left. \nThen pass Broadale Estate on the left. \nTake the left turn after Broadale and travel to small roundabout. \nTake the 1st exit and enter Fort Hill. \nAt junction stay left and take the 1st right. \nHouse located on the left hand side. See number on the door.",
